function customerPayoutHistory(x){const labels={pending:'Ожидает выплаты',paid:'Выплачена',rejected:'Отклонена · резерв возвращён'};return x.withdrawals?.length?`<section class="data-card" aria-label="Заявки на вывод"><h2>Заявки на вывод</h2>${x.withdrawals.map(w=>`<div class="ledger-row" data-customer-payout="${Number(w.id)}"><span><strong>Заявка #${Number(w.id)}</strong><small>${esc(labels[w.status]||w.status)}</small></span><b>${planRub(w.amount)}</b></div>`).join('')}</section>`:''}

// Native Support and Freeman AI share this operator workspace and persisted ticket.
function supportOperatorConversation(){
 const ticket=state.support?.selected;
 if(!ticket)return null;
 return {
  id:ticket.id,ticket_id:ticket.id,
  channel:ticket.channel==='site'?'website':ticket.channel,
  mode:ticket.status==='closed'?'closed':ticket.routing_mode||'human',workspace:true,
  client:{...ticket.client,can_open_profile:!!ticket.client?.id,can_view_subscriptions:!!ticket.client?.id&&!!state.data?.payments?.owner_free},
  capabilities:{reply:ticket.status!=='closed',attachments:true,dictation:true,support_reply:true},
  quick_replies:state.support.quick_replies||[],
  messages:(ticket.messages||[]).map(message=>({...message,role:message.sender==='agent'?'assistant':message.role==='admin'?'operator':message.role}))
 };
}
async function supportWorkspaceApi(path,body,method,options={}){
 const ticketPath=/^\/api\/web\/support\/tickets\/(\d+)(\/reply)?$/.exec(path);
 if(ticketPath){
  const ticketId=Number(ticketPath[1]);
  if(ticketPath[2]){
   path='/api/web/support/messages';
   body={...body,ticket_id:ticketId,response_status:state.extra.replyStatus||'waiting_client'};
  }else{
   const response=await fetch(supportUrl(ticketId),{cache:'no-store',signal:options.signal});
   const result=await response.json();
   if(!response.ok){const error=Error(result.detail||'Не удалось обновить переписку');error.status=response.status;throw error;}
   // A late response must never replace a different ticket opened in the meantime.
   if(Number(state.supportTicket)!==ticketId||state.view!=='support')return null;
   state.support=supportMergePoll(state.support,result);
   return supportOperatorConversation();
  }
 }
 const response=await fetch(path,{
  method:method||(body?'POST':'GET'),headers:body?{'Content-Type':'application/json'}:{},
  body:body?JSON.stringify(body):undefined,cache:'no-store',signal:options.signal
 });
 const result=await response.json();
 if(!response.ok){const error=Error(typeof result.detail==='string'?result.detail:'Не удалось выполнить запрос');error.status=response.status;throw error;}
 return result;
}
function supportOperatorChat(){
 if(window.supportOperatorWorkspace)return window.supportOperatorWorkspace;
 return window.supportOperatorWorkspace=FreemanChatWorkspace.create({
  root:app,shellViewport:true,openClient:async id=>{supportOperatorChat().leave();await openAdminCustomer(id)},openKey:async (id,options)=>{await openAdminKey(id,options)},prepareSend:prepareSupportSound,onSent:playSupportSentSound,
  formAttributes:'data-support-message',backAttributes:'data-support-back',backIcon:'chevron-left',backLabel:'К списку чатов',
  context:conversation=>`<a class="ai-support-context" href="/admin/ai?chat=ticket-${Number(conversation.id)}" aria-label="Все диалоги в Freeman AI" title="Все диалоги в Freeman AI">${FreemanComponents.icon('headset')}<span>Все диалоги</span></a>`,
  extraActions:()=>'<button type="button" data-support-menu>Другие действия</button>',
  current:()=>state.view==='support'&&!state.extra.supportOpening&&state.support?.is_admin&&state.supportTicket?supportOperatorConversation():null,
  enabled:()=>true,api:supportWorkspaceApi,url:id=>'/api/web/support/tickets/'+id,
  format:text=>esc(text),channel:channel=>supportChannel(channel==='website'?'site':channel),
  mode:mode=>mode==='closed'?'Завершено':mode==='ai'?'Назначен агент':'У специалиста',setCurrent:()=>{}
 });
}
app.addEventListener('submit',event=>{
 if(!event.target.matches('[data-fo-chat-workspace] .ai-compose'))return;
 event.preventDefault();void supportOperatorChat().submit(event.target);
});
const supportModePending=new Set();
app.addEventListener('click',event=>{
 const button=event.target.closest('[data-fo-chat-workspace] [data-mode]');
 if(!button)return;
 void (async()=>{
  const ticket=state.supportTicket;
  if(!ticket||!state.support?.is_admin||supportModePending.has(ticket))return;
  const mode=button.dataset.mode;
  if(mode==='closed'&&!await FreemanUI.confirm('Закрыть обращение? Переписка сохранится.'))return;
  if(state.view!=='support'||state.supportTicket!==ticket)return;
  if(mode!=='ai'){
   await changeSupportStatus(mode==='closed'?'closed':'in_progress');
   return;
  }
  if(isPreview()){
   state.support.selected.routing_mode='ai';
   render();
   return;
  }
  supportModePending.add(ticket);
  button.disabled=true;
  try{
   await supportWorkspaceApi(`/api/web/admin/ai/tickets/${ticket}/mode`,{mode:'ai'});
   if(state.view==='support'&&state.supportTicket===ticket){
    await loadSupport(ticket);
    say('Диалог передан агенту');
   }
  }catch(error){
   say(error.message);
  }finally{
   supportModePending.delete(ticket);
   button.disabled=false;
  }
 })();
});

// The gesture activates the same Back button as keyboard/pointer navigation.
// One mobile Back gesture owner for Support chats; other screens keep explicit Back controls.
function cabinetSwipeTarget(){return state.view==='support'&&state.supportTicket?app.querySelector('.screen:not([hidden]) .native-chat,.screen:not([hidden]) [data-fo-chat-workspace]'):null}
function cabinetSwipeReady(){if(state.view!=='support'||!state.supportTicket)return false;if(!state.data||state.view==='purchase'||CheckoutRecovery.pending()||state.busy||state.extra.routePending||state.extra.supportOpening||app.querySelector('.ai-compose[aria-busy=true],.native-composer[aria-busy=true]'))return false;const screen=app.querySelector('.screen:not([hidden])');if(!screen)return false;if(screen.querySelector('[data-dirty=true],[aria-busy=true]')||[...screen.querySelectorAll('[data-cp-note] textarea')].some(n=>n.value!==n.defaultValue))return false;return (CabinetNavigation.current?.index||0)>0||!![...screen.querySelectorAll('[data-nav-back],[data-support-back],[data-support-return],[data-cp-return]')].find(n=>n.getClientRects().length)}
window.supportSwipeBack=PageMotion.swipeBack({root:app,target:cabinetSwipeTarget,enabled:cabinetSwipeReady,back:()=>{const screen=app.querySelector('.screen:not([hidden])'),button=[...screen.querySelectorAll('[data-nav-back],[data-support-back],[data-support-return],[data-cp-return]')].find(n=>n.getClientRects().length);PageMotion.intent(-1);if(button)button.click();else void CabinetNavigation.back()}});

// Read-only refresh while customer Proxy is visible; preserve dialogs and focus.
let proxyRefreshPending=false;
async function refreshVisibleProxy(){if(proxyRefreshPending||document.hidden||state.view!=='proxy'||!state.extra.proxy||state.modal||document.querySelector('.px-drawer'))return;proxyRefreshPending=true;const owner=state.data?.profile?.id;try{const r=await fetch('/api/web/proxy',{cache:'no-store'});if(!r.ok)return;const x=await r.json();const signature=v=>JSON.stringify((v.items||v.credentials||[]).map(i=>[i.id,i.status,i.expires_at,i.link,i.source,i.can_renew]));if(state.data?.profile?.id===owner&&state.view==='proxy'&&!state.modal&&!document.querySelector('.px-drawer')&&signature(x)!==signature(state.extra.proxy)){state.extra.proxy=x;renderInPlace()}}catch{}finally{proxyRefreshPending=false}}
setInterval(refreshVisibleProxy,5000);window.addEventListener('focus',refreshVisibleProxy);document.addEventListener('visibilitychange',()=>{if(!document.hidden)refreshVisibleProxy()});

document.addEventListener('click',e=>{const button=e.target.closest('[data-support-rich-preview]');if(!button)return;const f=button.closest('[data-quick-reply]');if(!f)return;const saved=state.extra.supportSettings?.quick_replies?.find(q=>q.id===Number(f.dataset.replyId));FreemanUI.replyPreview({title:f.elements.title.value,text:f.elements.text.value,attachments:saved?.attachments||[]},{label:'Закрыть',onUse:()=>{}})});

document.addEventListener('fo:message-edited',e=>{for(const message of state.support?.selected?.messages||[]){if(Number(message.edit_id||message.read_id)===e.detail.id){message.text=e.detail.text;message.edit_version=e.detail.version;message.edited=!!e.detail.edited_at}}});

// Reload the authoritative chat after a server action has saved its reply.
document.addEventListener('fo-agent-result', event => {
  if (state.view !== 'support' || !state.supportTicket || state.extra.supportSettingsPage) return;
  const ticket = state.supportTicket;
  loadSupport(ticket).then(() => {
    if (event.detail?.focusComposer && state.view === 'support' && state.supportTicket === ticket)
      app.querySelector('[data-support-message] textarea')?.focus({preventScroll:true});
  }).catch(error => say(error.message));
});
